{"_note":"私有单对象组件(build / quality / insights / pending / pending21)的点击:appId 有值就用它;留空时用组件流记下的「这次显示的那个 App」(wpick.b = 最新构建所属 App,wpick.n = 账号里按名字排第一个),都没有才带空串(页面自己回落)。⚠️ nav.open 的 numable:// 写包自己的 ULID,不写 self(桌面小组件回放那条路没有「当前包」上下文)。onClick 串只能引用实例 params,引用不到流输出,所以走 .af。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"aIn","value":"${appId}"},"_note":"入参落地(勿删)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"kIn","value":"${k}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"toIn","value":"${to}"}},{"id":"pk","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"wpick.${kIn}","default":""}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"id","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${aIn},${pk})]"},"_note":"兼作 data.get 之后的屏障。"},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${toIn},reviews),1,0)]"},"items":[{"action":"nav.open","params":{"url":"numable://01KZD9PY65Y9341817EEV4VT31/page/reviews?appId=${id}&country="}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${toIn},reviews),0,1)]"},"items":[{"action":"nav.open","params":{"url":"numable://01KZD9PY65Y9341817EEV4VT31/page/app?appId=${id}&country="}}]}]}
